### Mendapatkan semua data produk (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/products

### Mendapatkan data produk berdasarkan ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/products/1

### Menambahkan produk baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productnam": "Keyboard",
  "category": "Device Computer",
  "price": 90000,
  "stock": 15
}

### Memperbarui data produk (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productname": "Speaker Active 1500 Watt",
  "category": "Device Computer",
  "price": 750000,
  "stock": 3
}

### Menghapus data produk (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/products/1

